                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d41636f-705b-326d-944d-9adcf8535fbd",
                        "entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "занятие, увлечение наукой, искусством без достаточной специальной подготовки"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca3ad3cb-db2d-4908-ba4d-1b87d7e2580a",
                                "sense_id": "2d41636f-705b-326d-944d-9adcf8535fbd",
                                "text": "Дилетантизм любителя не помешал ему сделать открытие."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3154a380-7032-3d98-b10a-1ed3e2070105",
                        "entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "поверхностное отношение к чему-либо, отсутствие необходимых специальных знаний"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9ec8e9e-094d-41d7-9185-fab5933160ef",
                                "sense_id": "3154a380-7032-3d98-b10a-1ed3e2070105",
                                "text": "Проявить дилетантизм"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab5cec8b-977b-4498-b5ac-990b28d421cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "dilettantism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dilettantism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcde2106-2360-3060-b5ec-4efbfdb06a67",
                                        "entry_id": "1ecc402a-d174-39f6-bf5e-74588da26a72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of behaving like a dilettante, of being an amateur or \\\"dabbler\\\", sometimes in the arts. Also the act of enjoying the arts, being a connoisseur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9979930-e3e3-46b5-82b7-65ebfccd9976",
                                                "sense_id": "fcde2106-2360-3060-b5ec-4efbfdb06a67",
                                                "text": "The brawny craftsman finds it no child's play to mould his unpliant rugged masses; neither is guidance of men a dilettantism: what it becomes when treated as a dilettantism, we may see!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bc49df4-1019-4562-9f0a-d3baf3a2d521",
                                                "sense_id": "fcde2106-2360-3060-b5ec-4efbfdb06a67",
                                                "text": "As Erasmus would find, the king and his advisers had a hard-edged attitude to scholarship that was worlds away from the enquiring dilettantism of Eltham."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "805afffc-3f06-466b-b97f-81dfdd7c08ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "diletantismo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "diletantismo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3466ffb4-294e-3d35-9e2b-798ff28d9794",
                                        "entry_id": "c44c7c9a-d4a6-30e9-869e-fd1dab59fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Estado o comportamiento de diletante, de ser un aficionado o de participar superficialmente en algo, usualmente de las artes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "158c827e-a89d-4c0d-a9d4-c44f8bd5d6c2",
                                                "sense_id": "3466ffb4-294e-3d35-9e2b-798ff28d9794",
                                                "text": "Más allá de que hubiera dolo o solo diletantismo, Macri había mordido el anzuelo de los colaboradores de Bergoglio, que para variar eran militantes peronistas."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d80e12d-c7a4-31c5-ac08-4cff5ef8a52f",
                                        "entry_id": "c44c7c9a-d4a6-30e9-869e-fd1dab59fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acción de disfrutar de las artes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b7ad82c-4184-42e6-b26b-63238d0d9300",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dilettantismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dilettantismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c730b72-5e46-3378-a6d7-d5492e696dbf",
                                        "entry_id": "e77d74ae-771d-3fb8-a557-a15d4fd5f4f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Betätigung (in der Kunst oder Wissenschaft) ohne fachliche Ausbildung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a30825c3-2bea-4371-ab8c-92b143b561f1",
                                                "sense_id": "4c730b72-5e46-3378-a6d7-d5492e696dbf",
                                                "text": "Das Handeln der Politiker grenzt an Dilettantismus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aaa052c-9f55-4c15-9a75-d59fd0977e5e",
                                                "sense_id": "4c730b72-5e46-3378-a6d7-d5492e696dbf",
                                                "text": "Die Sicherheitsvorkehrungen und das Krisenmanagement wurden später als \"ausgesprochener Dilettantismus\" bezeichnet."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e32f4bf5-225f-45b0-91d4-22167965a872",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "dyletantyzm",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd6aa205-6906-4874-9ad9-63494a538e67",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8374b7c-a192-36f2-ad1e-7927bad47b6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "dilettantisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dilettantisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "699e2394-f141-3915-82d8-81b62d4534f8",
                                        "entry_id": "665a5383-b099-34ef-9e41-864df2f0b4f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère ou manière d’être de celui qui est dilettante, qui n’est pas professionnel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58327272-ebbf-4834-b3f5-537cd99e53ab",
                                                "sense_id": "699e2394-f141-3915-82d8-81b62d4534f8",
                                                "text": "Il va de soi que cette capacité d'écrire sur des sujets aussi différents lui valut son lot de critiques : on lui reprocha ainsi de ne pas connaître suffisamment les sciences sur lesquelles il écrivait et, en fin de compte, de faire preuve de dilettantisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead3024e-57e4-42a0-9687-89a6b24f44ab",
                                                "sense_id": "699e2394-f141-3915-82d8-81b62d4534f8",
                                                "text": "Elle n'était pas amoureuse, mais elle aimait paraître avec le bel Italien qui exhibait sa fortune de manière un peu ostentatoire et démontrait un dilettantisme ajoutant à son charme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff427445-7829-4c2c-b603-291277821508",
                                                "sense_id": "699e2394-f141-3915-82d8-81b62d4534f8",
                                                "text": "Faire quelque chose par dilettantisme, par pur dilettantisme : Sans y tenir, sans y avoir intérêt, par plaisir."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
